>> title: Snickerdoodles
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: cinnamon, sugar, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: snickerdoodle, cinnamon sugar cookies
>> servings: 48
>> time: 30 min
>> step.2: cream
>> step.3: beat in
>> step.7: roll in cinnamon sugar, bake 400°F (205°C) 9 min

Heat the #oven{} to 400°F (205°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

Cream @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(113 g; softened) with @vegetable shortening{1/2%cup}(95 g) and @granulated sugar{1 1/2%cup}(300 g).

Beat @eggs{2%large}(100 g) into @&(~1)creamed mixture{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 3/4%cup}(345 g), @cream of tartar{2%tsp}(6 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g), and @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

Stir together @granulated sugar{1/4%cup}(50 g) and @ground cinnamon{2%tsp}(5 g).

Roll @&(~2)dough{} into balls in @&(~1)cinnamon sugar{} and bake at 400°F for ~{9%min}.
